The fully patched (to patchlevel 6) source to NetHack3 is now available
for anon ftp or uucp. On host 'uunet.uu.net' (ftp or uunet uucp
subscribers):
	~ftp/comp.sources.games/nethack3pl6/nh3p6.tar.[00-10].Z

On host 'saab' (uucp only):
	/usr/spool/ftp/games-archive/NetHack3pl6/nh3p6.tar.[00-10].Z

Each part is ~100Kbytes. The above directories also contain copies of:
	ndmake45.arc
	termcap.arc
	tmac.n.Z
as well as the file "README".

Also, by popular request, a copy of the current version of "patch" is
available from:
	~ftp/comp.sources.games/patch.tar.Z		(uunet)
or
	/usr/spool/ftp/games-archive/patch.tar.Z	(saab)

I am working on trying to get a copy set up at the European archive site, also.

